    "text": "Match List - I with List - II.<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-I (Salt)</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-II&nbsp;(Flame colour wavelength)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LiCl</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>455</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCl</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>670</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>RbCl</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>780</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CsCl</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>589</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
